T3 Code Mobile <Client>
=======================

This project is a fork of "opencode-mobile-client".

  Upstream:  https://github.com/bmpenuelas/opencode-mobile-client
  License:   MIT
  Copyright: (c) 2026 Borja Penuelas

The upstream project is a native Android/iOS client that renders the OpenCode
web UI in a WebView. This fork retargets that client at T3 Code
(https://t3.codes), the open-source control plane for coding agents by
T3 Tools Inc., which is itself MIT-licensed:

  T3 Code:   https://github.com/pingdotgg/t3code

Changes made in this fork
-------------------------

  * Replaced HTTP Basic authentication with T3 Code pairing tokens
    (parsed from `t3 pair` output, opened via the server's /pair route).
  * Added a T3 Connect entry point that opens https://app.t3.codes.
  * Health checks now target the T3 Code server root.
  * Removed OpenCode-specific WebView injections (composer/sidebar fixes,
    error hiding, enter=newline selector) and the demo-mode mock.
  * Rebranded the application (app id com.logicedge.t3codemobile, name
    "T3 Code Mobile", icons and splash screens from T3 Code's own artwork).
  * Retained the upstream device downloads/clipboard handling and
    external-link handling.

